    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100086" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεν-τείνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put on the stretch together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.70b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς κατ᾽ ἐπιγάστριον μῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.173
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>exert oneself also</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ομένης ἅμα τῆς κυούσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.73
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be on the stretch together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ ς. σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Muson.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					11p.58H.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.234
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.177
			</span></i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				4.13.11
			</span></i>.</div>
